   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- Three tokens meet at the MCP server: T2 comes in from the user, T3 proves the server's\n  own identity, and T4 goes out to the data as the user.\n- No MCP server holds a client secret: T3 is a managed identity token, trusted through a\n  federated credential. The only OAuth client secret, abw-agent-client's, sits in the five\n  Foundry OAuth connections and the git-ignored .secrets folder.\n- A role change reaches the gateway with the next token you request (up to about 30 s; one\n  removal lagged longer), but the agent keeps the T2 Foundry already holds until it expires.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "- Three tokens meet at the MCP server: T2 comes in from the user, T3 proves the server's\n  own identity, and T4 goes out to the data as the user.\n- No MCP server holds a client secret: T3 is a managed identity token, trusted through a\n  federated credential. The only OAuth client secret, abw-agent-client's, sits in the five\n  Foundry OAuth connections and the git-ignored .secrets folder.\n- A role change reaches the gateway with the next token you request (up to about 30 s; one\n  removal lagged longer), but the agent keeps the T2 Foundry already holds until it expires.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
