   "text": "Ask again. Bearer T1 (audience https://ai.azure.com, oid = the user). In Act 7 the call\nenters through APIM /agents, which forwards T1 unchanged (diagram 11).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
