   "text": "Foundry checks T1 (Foundry Agent Consumer on the\nproject), runs the agent, then calls the tool: tools/call\nget_deal_document with Bearer T2.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
